######################
# Unsubstituted placeholders
######################
#
# PathUtils leaves an unset [Name] in a PgeConfig as the literal text, so a
# command like mkdir -p "[JobOutputDir]" creates a directory with brackets in
# its name in whatever directory it ran from. Run the join by hand inside a
# clone and "git add -A" commits it -- which is how [JobOutputDir]/join.done
# reached master on 2026-09-28 and sat there for three days.
#
# Bracket is a character class in gitignore, so both are escaped.
\[*\]/
